@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = replace-with-access-token
@categoryId = 1
@accountId = 1
@transactionId = 1

### 分类树
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?categoryType=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 账户列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新增支出（金额单位：分）
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionType": 1,
  "amount": "3800",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "currency": "CNY",
  "transactionTime": "2026-09-06T04:00:00.000Z",
  "remark": "午餐"
}

### 流水分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?currentPage=1&pageSize=20&startTime=2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z&endTime=2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 首页概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/overview?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 月度趋势
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/trend?view=month&month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 月度账单
GET {{baseUrl}}/bills/monthly?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CSV 导出（最多 366 天）
GET {{baseUrl}}/exports/transactions.csv?startTime=2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z&endTime=2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
